@authUrl = http://localhost:5001/api/auth
@productsUrl = http://localhost:5002/api/products
@ordersUrl = http://localhost:5003/api/orders

### 1. Register an ADMIN user
POST {{authUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "AdminPass123!",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 2. Register a regular USER
POST {{authUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "UserPass123!"
}

### 3. Login as Admin (copy the returned token into @adminToken below)
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin1",
  "password": "AdminPass123!"
}

### 4. Login as User (copy the returned token into @userToken below)
POST {{authUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "UserPass123!"
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
@adminToken = PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
@userToken = PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 5. Get current user profile (either token)
GET {{authUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. Admin creates a product
POST {{productsUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Wireless Mouse",
  "stockQty": 50
}

### 7. List products (paginated) - any authenticated user
GET {{productsUrl}}?pageNumber=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 8. Get product by ID (replace with a real ID from step 6's response)
GET {{productsUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 9. Admin updates stock directly
PUT {{productsUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stockQty": 100
}

### 10. User places an order (OrderService validates JWT, checks stock via InventoryService, reduces stock, saves order as CONFIRMED)
POST {{ordersUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "productId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### 11. User views their own order history
GET {{ordersUrl}}/my-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12. Get a specific order by ID (owner or admin only, replace with a real order ID)
GET {{ordersUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. Cancel an order (restores stock, sets status to CANCELLED)
PATCH {{ordersUrl}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 14. Admin: list ALL orders across all users (bonus endpoint beyond the base spec)
GET {{ordersUrl}}?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 15. Negative test: User attempting to create a product directly should be 403 Forbidden
POST {{productsUrl}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productName": "Should Fail",
  "stockQty": 10
}
